            <ArticleTitle>Complete Genome Sequence of a New Isolate of Solenopsis invicta virus 3 from Solenopsis invicta × richteri Hybrid Ants.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">e01273-17</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1128/genomeA.01273-17</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Solenopsis invicta virus 3 (SINV-3) is a positive-sense, single-stranded RNA virus that infects the red imported fire ant, Solenopsis invicta Buren. We report here the full genome (10,383 nucleotides) of an isolate infecting Solenopsis invicta × richteri hybrid ants, which we have identified as SINV-3 hybrid.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
